{"title":"Career Roadmap · Video Editor","role":"Video Editor","summary":"A Video Editor transforms raw video, audio, graphics and visual assets into finished content for films, advertising, television, social media, corporate communication, documentaries, OTT platforms and digital media.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Visual Communication / Film Making / Cinematography"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Visual Communication / Film Making / Cinematography → Video Editor"},{"type":"p","text":"A Video Editor transforms raw video, audio, graphics and visual assets into finished content for films, advertising, television, social media, corporate communication, documentaries, OTT platforms and digital media."},{"type":"p","text":"This is a directly aligned career for B.Sc Visual Communication / Film Making / Cinematography. The most important early-career differentiator is a strong showreel and portfolio, supported by editing technique, storytelling, sound, colour and motion-graphics skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Career facts"},{"type":"table","header":["Item","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"B.Sc Visual Communication / Film Making / Cinematography"}],[{"text":"Entry career"},{"text":"Video Editor"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Film · Media · Digital Content · Post-Production"}],[{"text":"Strongest foundations"},{"text":"Editing + storytelling + cinematography"}],[{"text":"Core software"},{"text":"Premiere Pro / DaVinci Resolve / Final Cut Pro"}],[{"text":"Supporting software"},{"text":"After Effects + Photoshop + Audition"}],[{"text":"Portfolio priority"},{"text":"Showreel + 8–12 strong projects"}],[{"text":"Long-term route"},{"text":"Video Editor → Senior Editor → Lead Editor → Post-Production Supervisor/Editor"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career-route check"},{"type":"note","label":"Direct alignment","text":"Yes."},{"type":"p","text":"Common entry titles include Junior Video Editor, Assistant Editor, Post-Production Assistant, Content Editor, Video Editing Intern and Social Media Video Editor."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What should I focus on?"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Master editing, storytelling, sound, colour grading and motion graphics; build a professional showreel."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in advertising, film, documentary, YouTube, OTT, corporate or social-media content."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Become Senior Editor, Lead Editor, Post-Production Supervisor or Editor/Director for independent projects."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into Creative Director, Post-Production Head, Film Editor, Content Studio Lead or build your own production business."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Editing fundamentals + visual storytelling"},{"text":"University + practical projects"},{"text":"5 edited videos"},{"text":"Foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Continuity + pacing + transitions"},{"text":"Editing practice"},{"text":"Short narrative edit"},{"text":"Editing skill"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Sound editing + colour correction"},{"text":"DaVinci/Premiere training"},{"text":"Dialogue/music mix"},{"text":"Post-production"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Motion graphics + titles"},{"text":"After Effects"},{"text":"Motion-graphics reel"},{"text":"Visual communication"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Documentary/commercial editing"},{"text":"Real projects"},{"text":"2–3 professional-style videos"},{"text":"Storytelling"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Media internship"},{"text":"Production house/media company"},{"text":"Internship credits + work samples"},{"text":"Industry exposure"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced editing + colour"},{"text":"Professional projects"},{"text":"Advanced showreel"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Portfolio + freelance/client workflow"},{"text":"Industry mentor"},{"text":"Professional showreel"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"If the B.Sc. is a 3-year programme, compress the Year 4 activities into the final year."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"h","text":"Film and visual communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film language"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Cinematography"},{"text":"Screen grammar"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Camera techniques"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Directing"},{"text":"Scriptwriting"},{"text":"Storyboarding"},{"text":"Production design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Editing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Editing principles"},{"text":"Continuity editing"},{"text":"Montage"},{"text":"Rhythm"},{"text":"Pacing"},{"text":"Narrative structure"},{"text":"Shot selection"},{"text":"Scene construction"},{"text":"Multi-camera editing"},{"text":"Documentary editing"},{"text":"Commercial editing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Audio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sound recording"},{"text":"Dialogue editing"},{"text":"Noise reduction"},{"text":"Sound design"},{"text":"Foley"},{"text":"Music editing"},{"text":"Mixing"},{"text":"Loudness"},{"text":"Voice-over production"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Colour"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Colour correction"},{"text":"Colour grading"},{"text":"Exposure"},{"text":"White balance"},{"text":"Skin tones"},{"text":"Colour matching"},{"text":"LUTs"},{"text":"Primary correction"},{"text":"Secondary correction"},{"text":"Cinematic colour workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Editing software"},{"type":"p","text":"Master at least one primary editor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Premiere Pro"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve"},{"text":"Final Cut Pro"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media organisation"},{"text":"Proxy workflows"},{"text":"Multicam editing"},{"text":"Timeline management"},{"text":"Keyboard shortcuts"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Export presets"},{"text":"Codecs"},{"text":"Frame rates"},{"text":"Resolution"},{"text":"Aspect ratios"},{"text":"Colour spaces"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Motion graphics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe After Effects"},{"text":"Motion graphics"},{"text":"Kinetic typography"},{"text":"Lower thirds"},{"text":"Titles"},{"text":"Logo animation"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Visual effects"},{"text":"Compositing"},{"text":"Green-screen keying"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Image tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Lightroom"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Audio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Audition"},{"text":"Fairlight"},{"text":"Audacity"},{"text":"Basic DAW concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional editing workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Footage ingestion","Backup","Organisation","Proxy creation","Rough cut","Fine cut","Sound edit","Colour correction","Colour grade","Graphics/VFX","Review","Master export","Delivery","Archive"]},{"type":"h","text":"File management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Folder structures"},{"text":"Naming conventions"},{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"Backup strategy"},{"text":"Cloud storage"},{"text":"Proxy media"},{"text":"Project archiving"},{"text":"Asset management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI and modern video production"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Subtitle generation"},{"text":"Rough cuts"},{"text":"Scene detection"},{"text":"Object removal"},{"text":"Noise reduction"},{"text":"Voice cleanup"},{"text":"Colour assistance"},{"text":"Generative visual assets"},{"text":"Searchable media libraries"},{"text":"Translation/localisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But maintain human control over storytelling, editorial judgement, copyright, consent and factual accuracy."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film Editing"},{"text":"Premiere/Resolve + storytelling"},{"text":"Short films"},{"text":"Film Editor"}],[{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Editing + motion graphics + commercial storytelling"},{"text":"Ad agencies"},{"text":"Senior Commercial Editor"}],[{"text":"YouTube/Creator Content"},{"text":"Fast editing + graphics + retention"},{"text":"Creator projects"},{"text":"Lead Content Editor"}],[{"text":"Documentary"},{"text":"Narrative + interviews + archival media"},{"text":"Documentary projects"},{"text":"Documentary Editor"}],[{"text":"OTT/Post-Production"},{"text":"Advanced editing + colour + audio"},{"text":"Production houses"},{"text":"Post-Production Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Motion Graphics"},{"text":"After Effects + design"},{"text":"Motion projects"},{"text":"Motion Graphics Lead"}],[{"text":"Sports Editing"},{"text":"Multi-camera + highlights"},{"text":"Sports media"},{"text":"Sports Editor"}],[{"text":"Corporate Video"},{"text":"Editing + branding + interviews"},{"text":"Corporate media"},{"text":"Corporate Video Lead"}],[{"text":"Social Media"},{"text":"Short-form + captions + motion"},{"text":"Digital agencies"},{"text":"Social Video Lead"}],[{"text":"Colour Grading"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve + colour science"},{"text":"Colour projects"},{"text":"Colourist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Video editing will become increasingly AI-assisted, but storytelling, creative judgement, pacing, sound, colour and understanding the audience will remain differentiators. Learn AI tools as productivity multipliers rat